# OnePlus 3 / MSM8996 early-entry A/B: disable ARMv8.5 Memory Tagging.
#
# With the v74 strict configuration, Linux 7.2 enables ARM64_MTE by default.
# Unlike the booting pmOS 6.19.5 control, Linux 7.2 then includes
# TCR_EL1_TCMA1 in the TCR_EL1 value written by __cpu_setup() before the MMU
# is enabled. Cortex-A53/A72 in MSM8996 do not implement MTE. This one-symbol
# fragment removes only that 7.2 pre-MMU contribution; it is not a permanent
# policy or a substitute for early-boot evidence.
#
# Keep the v74 strict base config, v74 DTB, reference initrd and cmdline fixed.
# CONFIG_ARM64_MTE is not set
